    "title": "Free summer events return to Downtown Rochester with yoga, movies, and more - NewsBreak",
    "text": "ROCHESTER, N.Y. — Downtown Definitely events are coming back to Downtown Rochester with free events and activities available for all. Here’s what’s planned: At the Genesee Riverway Trail on Tuesday, July 8, August 12, and September 16 from 12 p.m. to 1 p.m., Yoga on the Riverway offers an outdoor yoga experience with an addition of goat and puppy yoga. Smoothies will be available for purchase, and the first 25 people to sign up will get a complementary yoga mat. For more information, and to sign up ahead of time, click here . Occurring at Parcel 5 on Wednesday, July 9, August 6, and September 10, from 11:30 a.m. to 1:30 p.m., Midday Bash provides the following for an active lunch break experience: For more information on the Midday Bash, click here . Taking place at Austin Steward Plaza on Thursday, July 27, July 31, August 21, and September 11 from 5 p.m. to 7 p.m., Sunset Sips provides an afterwork gathering with live music, drink tastings, and food vendors. Happening at Parcel 5 on Friday, July 18 and August 29 from 7 p.m. to 10 p.m., family friendly movie musicals, local food trucks, and the classic concession stand snacks will be available for everyone. If you plan on attending, you’re encouraged to bring your own chairs. Here are the following movies that will be played: For more information on the Movies With a Downtown View, click here . At Parcel 5 on Friday, July 11, from 6 p.m. to 10 p.m., the Rochester Philharmonic Orchestra will perform under the sky. The evening’s program, conducted by Jherrard Hardeman, will feature iconic music from film and stage. Food and drinks will be available for purchase. Attendees are encouraged to bring lawn chairs or blankets. To wrap up the Downtown Definitely events, the MVP Fall Fest will be taking place on Saturday, September 27, from 11 a.m. to 2 p.m. at Parcel 5. Here are the following activities that will be available: For more information on the MVP Fall Fest, click here .",
